    {
      "entry_id": "height-normal-second-method-and-strength",
      "subject": "Second height-to-normal method and the strength sweep (moved to a UI-recorded task)",
      "status": "gap",
      "formula": "Not fitted here. The height-to-normal method and its strength are project or shader settings the Python API can neither set nor read; the owner moved the second method and the strength sweep to phase0.7_tier0-semantics-ui-cases (recorded through Painter's UI, decision 029). Until that task records them they are release gaps.",
      "public_sources": [
        {
